  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "en-US",
    "key": "dungeon.9205.description",
    "text": "<color=#f04f84>Recommended: [Illusion-Breaking Strength] 1450.</color><br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\">The mysterious power in the woods grants additional abilities to different roles:<br>Guard: When Class Skills deal damage, they inflict an extra instance of fixed damage equal to a percentage of DEF and HP.<br>Support: When casting non-damaging skills, deals AoE damage to the surroundings.<br>Attack: Illusion-Breaking DMG +10%.</style></i><br>Within the deep illusion known as [Illusion], a hazy mist woven from fine crystals permeates the air. Artisans believe this is a trace of misalignment between reality and illusion. Perhaps it has always existed in every illusion, but is simply too subtle to have been noticed until now.<br><br>To fully uncover the origins of the illusion, the artisans constructed a denser illusion test area, the [Illusion-Shroud Woods], and developed devices to resist its corruption, guiding adventurers deep within to uncover the truth behind the [Illusory Plague].",
    "availability": [
      {
        "deployment_id": "global",
        "channel": "steam",
        "client_build": "24252055"
      }
    ],
    "provenance": {
      "source": "official-game-localization",
      "reference": "client-build:global/steam/24252055#localization-766599609",
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
  }
